In today's World, Technology Plays A Crucial Role... Even Though It Can Be Used To Hurtfully Express Grudges After Being Wronged.

Technology can be used to express hurtful opinions when holding onto grudges, especially if someone has been wronged. For example, in this digital age, one can easily write a malicious blog post or send a venomous text message to make their point and punish the person who wronged them. Such actions may provide a sense of satisfaction in the short term but will ultimately do more harm than good in the long run as they perpetuate negativity and prevent resolution. 
